What is the need of Spring Boot
	SpringBoot = Spring++ 
	means its the abstraction over spring framework
	
Note : Framework is a software which is built on the top of one or more technologies to simplify
      the application development process by generating the common logics of the app dynamically.
      
      While developing the Apps using the frameworks the programmers should take care of the application
      specific business logic because the remaining logics will be generated by Framework dynamically
	
	In Spring we use xml files frequently but in Spring boot there is less use of xml files 
	
	Spring boot = spring - xml cfgs + AutoConfigurations
